  (text "CC loop: U301A compares the DAC setpoint with the shunt voltage. Summing node INP = (SETP - I*Rshunt)/2, so the loop settles at I = SETP / 10 mOhm."
    (at 25 212.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid fed9d671-92aa-4944-8350-61ba1ab70985))
  (text "Setpoint: MCP4725 #1 (0x60) 0-3.3 V, divided by R301/R302 to 0-108 mV -> 0-10.8 A full scale (~2.6 mA per LSB)."
    (at 25 216.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 2f91b3c0-4994-49fa-94df-6a83e5a2518e))
  (text "Q301 IRFP260N (TO-247) in linear mode at the board edge, bolted to the CPU-cooler heatsink, with the external 0.1 Ohm 50 W aluminium resistor (J301) in series to share the heat."
    (at 25 221.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 1627646d-29f6-4971-b784-06b5484ec7e9))
  (text "Kill: Q302 (LOAD_OFF from MCU, pulled up = off at boot) and Q303 (hardware FAULT) short INP to ground -> gate goes low."
    (at 25 225.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 9dfa2f35-f143-40f0-a261-0e7be8eb3e89))
  (text "Sequence: close K2 with LOAD_OFF high, release LOAD_OFF with DAC = 0, then ramp the DAC."
    (at 25 230.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 9e3aa227-ec2f-47b0-ba20-ff52f6f20797))
  (text "U301B: bidirectional current monitor for the fast internal ADC and the OC comparators: I_MON = 1.65 V + 0.12 V/A (approx -13 A ... +13 A)."
    (at 25 234.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid dfc40238-93c7-4fcd-98ce-ee370a007b21))
  (text "U301 = OPA2188AID (SOIC-8, zero-drift, 36 V). MCP4725 module pin order differs between sellers: check U302 before soldering the socket."
    (at 25 239.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 84a3d4f2-bb7e-4376-a8a7-3934e97c6d56)))
